{"4912110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mayhem Duck Simulator", "steam_appid": 4912110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4948480], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912110/extras/d11401df44832aa508e62fe9c75e4bd3.poster.avif?t=1788291363\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912110/extras/d11401df44832aa508e62fe9c75e4bd3.webm?t=1788291363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912110/extras/d11401df44832aa508e62fe9c75e4bd3.mp4?t=1788291363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912110/extras/f620c8600aa700b3f8a12d5c09b7c36e.poster.avif?t=1788291363\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912110/extras/f620c8600aa700b3f8a12d5c09b7c36e.webm?t=1788291363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912110/extras/f620c8600aa700b3f8a12d5c09b7c36e.mp4?t=1788291363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i><strong>Are you ready to explore the freedom of being a rubber duck? 🦆</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Step into a peaceful, physics-based world where ducks slowly rain down from the sky. Mayhem Duck Simulator is the ultimate plastic duck simulator experience, designed for those who want to spend a calm day as well as those looking to stir up some serious trouble.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You aren't just a regular duck; you are the master of the pool! ✨</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Key Features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Relax or Wreak Havoc: Whether you want to sunbathe and drift peacefully on the water or use your special abilities to turn the pool upside down, the choice is yours in this unique plastic duck simulator.</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Unique &quot;Special Ducks&quot;: Discover special ducks, each with their own unique powers!</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dragon Duck: Breathe fire! 🔥</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>UFO Duck: Abduct other ducks into the sky! 🛸</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wizard Duck: Grow your friends to massive sizes! ✨</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Magnet Duck: Attract a flock and go on a road trip! 🦆</strong></i></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Rescue and Collect: Find the special ducks trapped behind iron bars, rescue them, and add them to your pool. Every new duck means a new type of chaos in your plastic duck simulator collection!</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Customize: Take control of every duck, give them custom names, and grow your collection.</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Sit Back and Unwind: No quests, no timers, no stress. Watch them drift like a screensaver on your second monitor while you work, or hop in during your coffee break to stir things up!</strong></i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>This game is perfect for you if:</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You are looking for a fun plastic duck simulator that lets you escape from tedious quests and complex mechanics.</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You are looking for a &quot;relaxing&quot; game that still lets you indulge in occasional madness.</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You enjoy hilarious, physics-based sandbox fun. 🦆</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>There is a &quot;relaxing&quot; mode... but how long it stays relaxing depends entirely on your creativity! 😏</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>In Mayhem Duck Simulator, you will either find peace or create pure chaos. The choice is yours! ✨</strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912110/extras/83c6583feaf71884d77854418faf340b.poster.avif?t=1788291363\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912110/extras/83c6583feaf71884d77854418faf340b.webm?t=1788291363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912110/extras/83c6583feaf71884d77854418faf340b.mp4?t=1788291363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912110/extras/d8a54690f2fdecc3853d53a207a77da8.poster.avif?t=1788291363\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912110/extras/d8a54690f2fdecc3853d53a207a77da8.webm?t=1788291363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912110/extras/d8a54690f2fdecc3853d53a207a77da8.mp4?t=1788291363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4912110/extras/d11401df44832aa508e62fe9c75e4bd3.po